682
00:39:52,794 --> 00:39:55,994
いいじゃん いいじゃん ノリノリでいんじゃない
Ain't it awesome, ain't it awesome, ain't it awesome to feel so good

683
00:39:55,994 --> 00:39:59,194
ハッピーはいつだってね “今”感じるもの
I'm always so happy, it's the way "now" feels

684
00:39:59,194 --> 00:40:00,694
生きろ乙女 本能で、裸の
Live on, fair maidens, with your bare instincts

685
00:40:00,415 --> 00:40:01,715
のーのーのー 終わるの？
No, no, no, is it ending?

686
00:40:01,715 --> 00:40:03,915
始まるの！
It's beginning!

687
00:40:07,815 --> 00:40:10,215
どうしよう オートマティックに
What should I do? Automatically...

688
00:40:10,215 --> 00:40:13,215
決められてる時間割じゃ追っつかないの
...the schedule we're given is too packed to keep up with!

689
00:40:13,215 --> 00:40:14,015
C!

690
00:40:14,015 --> 00:40:16,615
ユーモア ナチュラル めくるめく笑い
Humor, natural, dizzying laughter,

691
00:40:16,615 --> 00:40:19,215
ウケ過ぎでお腹痛い
my stomach hurts from laughing too much!

692
00:40:19,215 --> 00:40:19,815
T!

693
00:40:19,815 --> 00:40:22,815
呼吸ぴったしexcellent! でも苦手な
Our breathing is perfectly excellent! But there was still...

694
00:40:22,815 --> 00:40:25,415
リフまだあったの
...a riff I wasn't good at.

695
00:40:25,415 --> 00:40:26,015
E!

696
00:40:26,015 --> 00:40:28,615
特訓つきあってくれる？
Will you practice with me?

697
00:40:28,615 --> 00:40:31,215
も少し門限までだって帰りたくない
It's almost curfew, but I don't want to go home yet!

698
00:40:31,215 --> 00:40:33,815
never never... can't say good-bye

699
00:40:33,815 --> 00:40:35,715
めちゃめちゃ大好きっ！！
I love you so, so much!

700
00:40:35,715 --> 00:40:37,415
超絶ぞっこん ルララ Wonderful Show Time
I'm totally crazy about you! Lu-la-la, wonderful show time!

701
00:40:37,415 --> 00:40:40,415
音楽って 音楽って もう私達まんま
Music is, music is already just who we are!

702
00:40:40,415 --> 00:40:43,415
スタンディングオベーション賞 オーディエンスなしでも
Standing ovation award, even without an audience,

703
00:40:43,415 --> 00:40:46,415
奏得たい 瞬間のReal
we want to play this moment for real!

704
00:40:46,415 --> 00:40:48,915
昨日の後悔って 明日の心配って...
Regretting yesterday, worrying about tomorrow...

705
00:40:48,915 --> 00:40:51,915
ぶっちゃけぶっちゃけ 誰得？何得？
Honestly, honestly, what's the point? Who does it help?

706
00:40:51,915 --> 00:40:54,415
ラッキーはいつだってね “今”つかむもの
Good luck is always something you grab in the "now"!

707
00:40:54,415 --> 00:40:57,415
欲張り乙女 与えられん、さらば！
Be greedy, girls! If you aren't given it, say farewell!

708
00:40:57,415 --> 00:40:58,615
さらば！
Farewell!

709
00:41:21,415 --> 00:41:23,915
どんな本も書いてない
It's not written in any book,

710
00:41:23,915 --> 00:41:25,915
授業じゃちょっと教わらん
and they don't teach it in class,

711
00:41:25,915 --> 00:41:28,415
だけど一生忘れない
but I'll never forget it for the rest of my life.

712
00:41:28,415 --> 00:41:30,915
この世にないと思ってた奇跡
The miracle I thought didn't exist in this world,

713
00:41:30,915 --> 00:41:33,915
一緒にね歌えば 信じられるんだ
when we sing together, I can believe in it!

714
00:41:33,915 --> 00:41:36,915
強くなれるんだ
I can become stronger!

715
00:41:36,915 --> 00:41:38,915
みんなが大好きっ！
I love you all!

716
00:41:38,915 --> 00:41:41,415
延々続行 ルララ Miracle Sing Time
Continuing on forever! Lu-la-la, miracle sing time!

717
00:41:41,415 --> 00:41:43,915
歌って 歌って 愛伝える最強手段
I'll sing, I'll sing, it's the ultimate way to express my love!

718
00:41:43,915 --> 00:41:46,415
つたない曲でも 微妙な歌詞でも
Even if the song is clumsy or the lyrics are iffy,

719
00:41:46,415 --> 00:41:48,415
届けたい 精一杯のsoul
I want to convey my soul with all I have...

720
00:41:48,415 --> 00:41:50,915
等身大のlifeを
...along with our larger-than-life life!

721
00:41:50,915 --> 00:41:52,415
せーの！
One, two...

722
00:41:52,415 --> 00:41:54,915
今日は昨日みたい？ 明日は今日みたい？
Is today like yesterday? Is tomorrow like today?

723
00:41:54,915 --> 00:41:57,915
大丈夫大丈夫 楽しかったら大正解
It's okay, it's okay! If it was fun, then it's a huge success!

724
00:41:57,915 --> 00:42:00,915
ロッカーはいつだってね “今”やんちゃ盛り
Rockers are always in their rebellious phase in the "now"!

725
00:42:00,915 --> 00:42:04,915
進め乙女 抱きしめて、希望を
Onward, girls! Embrace your hopes!

726
00:42:04,915 --> 00:42:06,415
大好き！
I love you!

727
00:42:06,415 --> 00:42:11,915
大好き 大好き 大好きをありがとう
I love you, I love you, thank you for loving me too!

728
00:42:11,915 --> 00:42:17,915
歌うよ 歌うよ 心込めて今日も歌うよ
I'll sing, I'll sing, I'll sing with all my heart again today!

729
00:42:17,915 --> 00:42:23,415
大好き 大好き 大好きをありがとう
I love you, I love you, thank you for loving me too!

730
00:42:23,415 --> 00:42:29,415
歌うよ 歌うよ 愛を込めてずっと歌うよ
I'll sing, I'll sing, forever I'll sing with all my love!

731
00:42:45,415 --> 00:42:47,715
Please hold.

732
00:42:47,715 --> 00:42:51,915
We will soon be changing the channel.

733
00:42:51,915 --> 00:42:54,015
Please hold.

734
00:42:54,015 --> 00:42:57,415
We are about to switch the channel.

735
00:42:57,415 --> 00:42:59,415
Please wait.

736
00:42:59,415 --> 00:43:02,915
The channels will be changed soon.

737
00:43:02,915 --> 00:43:05,415
Please stay seated...

738
00:43:05,415 --> 00:43:08,915
...as the channels are about to switch.

739
00:43:09,415 --> 00:43:11,615
Don't change the channel...

740
00:43:11,615 --> 00:43:13,915
...because we'll do it for you.

741
00:43:13,915 --> 00:43:15,915
Do not touch the remote...

742
00:43:15,915 --> 00:43:18,415
...cause we will be doing it!

